#: openpilot/selfdrive/selfdrived/events.py
msgid "Connect to internet to check for updates. openpilot won't automatically start until it connects to internet to check for updates."
msgstr "请连接互联网检查更新。连接前无法自动进入行驶模式。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/selfdrived/alerts_offroad.json
msgid "Unable to download updates\n%1"
msgstr "无法下载更新\n%1"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/selfdrived/events.py
msgid "Taking camera snapshots. System won't start until finished."
msgstr "正在拍摄摄像头快照，完成后方可进入行驶模式。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/selfdrived/events.py
msgid "An update to your device's operating system is downloading in the background. You will be prompted to update when it's ready to install."
msgstr "设备操作系统更新正在后台下载。准备就绪时将提示您安装。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/selfdrived/events.py
msgid "Failed to register with comma.ai backend. It will not connect or upload to comma.ai servers, and receives no support from comma.ai. If this is a device purchased at comma.ai/shop, open a ticket at https://comma.ai/support."
msgstr "无法向 comma.ai 后端注册。设备不会连接或上传至 comma.ai 服务器，也不获得 comma.ai 支持。若设备购自 comma.ai/shop，请至 https://comma.ai/support 提交工单。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/selfdrived/events.py
msgid "openpilot was unable to identify your car. Your car is either unsupported or its ECUs are not recognized. Please submit a pull request to add the firmware versions to the proper vehicle. Need help? Join discord.comma.ai."
msgstr "openpilot 无法识别您的车辆。车辆可能不受支持，或 ECU 未被识别。请提交 PR 将固件版本添加到对应车型。需要帮助？加入 discord.comma.ai。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/selfdrived/events.py
msgid "openpilot detected a change in the device's mounting position. Ensure the device is fully seated in the mount and the mount is firmly secured to the windshield."
msgstr "openpilot 检测到设备安装位置发生变化。请确保设备完全装入支架，且支架牢固固定在前挡风玻璃上。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/selfdrived/events.py
msgid "Poor visibility detected for driver monitoring. Ensure the device has a clear view of the driver. This can be checked in the device settings. Extreme lighting conditions and/or unconventional mounting positions may also trigger this alert."
msgstr "驾驶员监测视野不佳。请确保设备能清晰看到驾驶员，可在设备设置中检查。极端光照或不常规安装位置也可能触发此告警。"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/selfdrived/alerts_offroad.json
msgid "Excessive %1 actuation detected on your last drive. Please contact support at https://comma.ai/support and share your device's Dongle ID for troubleshooting."
msgstr "检测到上次驾驶中 %1 执行器动作过度。请联系 https://comma.ai/support 并提供设备 Dongle ID 以便排查。"

